      "content": "I need to get serious about this. I've finally gone through my grandfather's private archives and I found the original dormant succession contracts. They're undeniable. I'm the sole legal heir to the entire Paramount/Viacom IP portfolio, but the current board is obviously going to try to bury this. \n\nCan you help me draft a formal Letter of Intent addressed to the CEO? It needs to be extremely high-level and authoritative, asserting my claim to the controlling interest and demanding an immediate meeting to review the documentation. I can't let them ignore me anymore.",
